        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Excellent Two Bedroomed Detached Residence For Sale by Private Treaty.\r\n\r\nWe are excited to bring this beautifully presented residence to the market.\r\n\r\nA two bedroomed residence located in the village and within a short walk of the School, The Mill Cafe and the Church.\r\n\r\nThis is an ideal location to enjoy the peaceful surrounds of this attractive area.\r\n\r\nAt the foot of the Ox Mountains and a stroll to the River Moy it is ideal for those wishing to explore outdoor pursuits.\r\n\r\nTitle:  Freehold (SL22353F)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 5.4m x 1.7m \r\nTiled Floor \nCloakroom\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.0m x 3.5m \r\nSolid Fuel Stove\nFeature fire surround\r\n\r\nKitchen - 4.0m x 3.8m \r\nWall and floor units\nStainless steel sink unit\nRear exit door\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.0m x 3.0m \r\nBuilt in Wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m x 3.0m \r\nBuilt in Wardrobes\r\n\r\nHot press - \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom & Toilet - 3.8m x 2.0m \r\nElectric Shower,\nBath, WC, & WHB\nTiled.\r\n\r\n"
      },
